<title>UK: Jan Ekofisk loadings up four cargoes at 31 - trade.</title>
<headline>Jan Ekofisk loadings up four cargoes at 31 - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The January schedule of Ekofisk crude loadings from the North Sea shows 31 cargoes, four higher than December, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The schedule comprised nine cargoes of 600,000 barrels, one cargo of 700,000 and 21 cargoes of 500,000 barrels.  </p>
<p>The January schedule details a total of 16.6 million barrels, against a December total of 14.77 million.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
